#X text 856 122 guess = w1 x[n-1] + w2 x[n-2] + ... + w8 x[n-8] / error = x[n] - guess / learning: w_k += mu * error * x[n-k] / k \, where k = x[n-1]^2 + ... + x[n-8]^2 (at least 8 x the recent average power). It runs at 1/8 of the sample rate., f 58;
