#X text 20 10 AROUND THE NEURON \, at the full sample rate: the input and the cross-synthesis excitation (a buzz \, or noise with breath) are lowpassed below 2.4 kHz before going down to 6 kHz (no mirror images of high partials) \, and the three results are lowpassed again after coming back up., f 150;
